# sakana-mcp — Cursor session context

## Session Context (sakana-mcp)

Before starting work: this repo is a FastMCP 3.4 stdio server (`src/sakana_mcp/server.py`,
8 tools: sakana_help, research_ideate/execute/status/review/library/workflow_plan, sakana_shutdown)
plus a FastAPI dashboard backend (`webapp/backend/app.py`, :10863) and a Vite frontend (:10862).
Run `just serve` (or `webapp/start.ps1`) and probe `GET /api/health` (must answer
`{"ok": true}` in <1s) before touching UI code.

At end of work: `uv run ruff check src/`, `bun x tsc --noEmit` in webapp/frontend,
and leave the tree green — never commit with a red gate.
